<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies five issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies five issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said it has qualified for bond insurance the following five municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Mount Pleasant Comm., Iowa, $4.210 million school general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Urbandale Comm. School District, Iowa, $4.9 million school bonds and $3.81 million school refunding bonds.</p>
<p>--Louisiana $225.625 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Stafford, Texas, $2 million improvement bonds.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650))</p>
</text>
